<office:body><office:text><text:h text:outline-level="1">Comments</text:h><text:p>Range: <office:annotation office:name="c0"><dc:creator>Ada Lovelace</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-01T10:30:00</dc:date><text:p>Range comment.</text:p></office:annotation>commented words<office:annotation-end office:name="c0"/> after.</text:p><text:p>Point here<office:annotation><dc:creator>Ada Lovelace</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-02T11:30:00</dc:date><text:p>Point comment.</text:p></office:annotation>.</text:p><text:p>Lines: <office:annotation office:name="c2"><dc:creator>Grace Hopper</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-03T12:30:00</dc:date><text:p>Across lines.</text:p><text:p>Second paragraph.</text:p></office:annotation>The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the committee reviews the quarterly figures. The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the committee reviews the quarterly figures. The quick brown fox jumps over the lazy dog while the committee reviews the quarterly figures. <office:annotation-end office:name="c2"/></text:p><text:p>Footnote call<text:note text:id="ftn1" text:note-class="footnote"><text:note-citation>1</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p>Note <office:annotation office:name="c13"><dc:creator>Ada Lovelace</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-04T09:00:00</dc:date><text:p>Footnote comment.</text:p></office:annotation>text<office:annotation-end office:name="c13"/></text:p></text:note-body></text:note></text:p><table:table table:name="T1"><table:table-column table:number-columns-repeated="2"/><table:table-row><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p><office:annotation office:name="c3"><dc:creator>Ada Lovelace</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-04T13:30:00</dc:date><text:p>Cell comment.</text:p></office:annotation>cell one<office:annotation-end office:name="c3"/></text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell office:value-type="string"><text:p>cell two</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row></table:table><text:p>Box: <draw:frame draw:name="Box" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="5cm" svg:height="1.2cm"><draw:text-box><text:p><office:annotation office:name="c4"><dc:creator>Ada Lovelace</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-05T14:30:00</dc:date><text:p>Box comment.</text:p></office:annotation>box text<office:annotation-end office:name="c4"/></text:p></draw:text-box></draw:frame></text:p><text:p>Across page: <office:annotation office:name="c5"><dc:creator>Alan Turing</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-06T15:30:00</dc:date><text:p>Across pages.</text:p></office:annotation>before break</text:p><text:p text:style-name="Break">after break<office:annotation-end office:name="c5"/></text:p><text:p>Reply and done: <office:annotation office:name="c7" loext:parent-name="c6"><dc:creator>Grace Hopper</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-08T17:30:00</dc:date><text:p>A reply.</text:p></office:annotation><office:annotation office:name="c6"><dc:creator>Ada Lovelace</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-07T16:30:00</dc:date><text:p>Parent of thread.</text:p></office:annotation>thread text<office:annotation-end office:name="c6"/><office:annotation-end office:name="c7"/> and <office:annotation office:name="c8" loext:resolved="true"><dc:creator>Alan Turing</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-09T18:30:00</dc:date><text:p>Resolved one.</text:p></office:annotation>resolved<office:annotation-end office:name="c8"/>.</text:p><text:p>Overlap <office:annotation office:name="c10"><dc:creator>Ada Lovelace</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-02T10:30:00</dc:date><text:p>Overlap A.</text:p></office:annotation>alpha <office:annotation office:name="c11"><dc:creator>Grace Hopper</dc:creator><dc:date>2026-03-03T11:30:00</dc:date><text:p>Overlap B.</text:p></office:annotation>beta<office:annotation-end office:name="c10"/> gamma<office:annotation-end office:name="c11"/>.</text:p></office:text></office:body>
